  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A wave undergoes simple harmonic motion (SHM). The graph shows how the displacement of the particles in the medium varies with the distance along the wave. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the magnitude of the restoring force that acts on the particles at A, B and C?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>A</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>B</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>C</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Maximum</td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td>Maximum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td>Maximum</td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td>Maximum</td>\n<td>Maximum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Maximum</td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n<td>Zero</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
